    { question: 'Does Smallpdf upload my PDF?', answer: 'Yes — that is how it works. Smallpdf states that files are encrypted in transit, processed on its servers in Europe and deleted after one hour. HatePDF does not upload the file at all; the operation runs inside your browser tab.' },
